WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.894
Here is how to install Frog Bot on a Mac. One command does everything, and it takes about two minutes.

00:00:08.294 --> 00:00:16.282
First, open Terminal. Press Command and Space together, type Terminal, and press Enter.

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:32.084
Go to the Frog Bot website and copy the Mac install command. Paste it into Terminal and press Enter. It downloads Frog Bot, puts it in your Applications folder, takes care of Mac security, and opens the app.

00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:40.922
Frog Bot opens on the sign up screen. Enter your name, your email, and a password of at least six characters.

00:00:41.322 --> 00:00:47.606
When Frog Bot opens, paste your Claude or OpenAI API key and click Start.

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:55.049
If you like, open Integrations at the bottom left to connect apps like Slack, Notion or GitHub.

00:00:55.449 --> 00:01:02.618
Now chat with Frog. Next time, open Frog Bot from Applications or Launchpad.

00:01:03.018 --> 00:01:14.140
If you downloaded the zip file instead, move Frog Bot to Applications, and run the command on screen once in Terminal. The install command does this for you.
